            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like SoundCloud's target audience is \nIndependent artists and people who like discovering new music. \nThe focus on uploading and creators makes it feel more \nfor musicians.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like SoundCloud's target audience is \nIndependent artists and people who like discovering new music. \nThe focus on uploading and creators makes it feel more \nfor musicians.",
