            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "What do you notice about the Target brand?",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "What do you notice about the Target brand?",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 18
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 795,
            "versionNonce": 1631574038,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "UJAuJIngPyOA8Ebhw9UgL",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 1,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 849.6522761846231,
            "y": 904.1733837315202,
            "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
            "backgroundColor": "transparent",
            "width": 461.6041564941406,
            "height": 25,
            "seed": 210217546,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773181844022,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "What do you notice about the Walmart brand?",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "What do you notice about the Walmart brand?",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 18
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 713,
            "versionNonce": 1838904650,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "c5HPB3dV0S3XfohmsPSF5",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 327.7249014810799,
            "y": 942.571431948604,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 523.1041870117188,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 1466945802,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182179984,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "The Target brand ...\n- Red and white color scheme — bright and cheerful.\n- Uses friendly fonts and playful seasonal themes (like Halloween).\n- Photos look warm and welcoming. ",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "The Target brand ...\n- Red and white color scheme — bright and cheerful.\n- Uses friendly fonts and playful seasonal themes (like Halloween).\n- Photos look warm and welcoming. ",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 675,
            "versionNonce": 1707116374,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "fLds1FnECckzaU3LMf5vi",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 859.2651323683563,
            "y": 956.9926210155868,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 436.1458435058594,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 1210392522,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182239805,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "The Walmart brand ... \n- Uses lots of white space and light blue/yellow colors.\n- Organized layout — easy to browse deals.\n- More practical and clean than flashy.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "The Walmart brand ... \n- Uses lots of white space and light blue/yellow colors.\n- Organized layout — easy to browse deals.\n- More practical and clean than flashy.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 699,
            "versionNonce": 2122334026,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "45jqO3Yy0VFQ8EOC0E6jJ",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 340.69370379692793,
            "y": 1130.316223435762,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 422.9375,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 2059572874,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182895796,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like Target's target audience is \nFamilies and everyday shoppers who want trendy but \naffordable products. The bright colors and seasonal \nads make it feel fun and welcoming.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like Target's target audience is \nFamilies and everyday shoppers who want trendy but \naffordable products. The bright colors and seasonal \nads make it feel fun and welcoming.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 751,
            "versionNonce": 1698617174,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "KEDSwHoEijdlol-1YiOe1",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 850.3099321730442,
            "y": 1142.9589585083058,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 482.6666564941406,
            "height": 60,
            "seed": 1342387530,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182908116,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like Walmart's target audience is \nFamilies and budget shoppers looking for deals. \nThe simple layout and focus on prices make it feel practical.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like Walmart's target audience is \nFamilies and budget shoppers looking for deals. \nThe simple layout and focus on prices make it feel practical.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 54
          }
        ],
